<item><title>Malawi&apos;s ruling party spokesperson says rules let Chakwera seek 2030 nomination</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-s-ruling-party-spokesperson-says-rules-let-chakwera-2c538e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-s-ruling-party-spokesperson-says-rules-let-chakwera-2c538e/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>Jessie Kabwila says the Malawi Congress Party&apos;s members wrote its rules and have the power to agree on Chakwera&apos;s candidacy.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:20:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
