<item><title>Malawi nurses warn shortages threaten deliveries and emergency surgery</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-nurses-warn-shortages-threaten-deliveries-and-414245/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-nurses-warn-shortages-threaten-deliveries-and-414245/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>The nurses’ organisation says missing medicines, anaesthetics and intravenous fluids put patients and health workers at risk across the country.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:58:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-nurses-warn-shortages-threaten-deliveries-and-414245/share.jpg" length="41245" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-nurses-warn-shortages-threaten-deliveries-and-414245/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
